flowchart TD
    UE["UiEvent"] --> HND["handle in ViewModel"]
    HND --> WOK{write ok?}
    WOK -->|yes| SSOT["SSOT Flow re-emits, new state"]
    WOK -->|no| RB["rollback + snackbar effect"]
    DF["data Flow"] --> RES{Resource?}
    RES -->|Success/Loading with data| CONTENT["Content"]
    RES -->|Error no data| ERR["Error + Retry"]
